{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>שטו.</b> Like 'they searched,' like משוט הארץ. Found in the Aggadah: <b>שטו העם ולקטו</b> — these are the righteous, who would eat it just as it descended." "<b>וטחנו ברחים או דכו במדכה.</b> These are the intermediate ones." "<b>ובשלו בפרור.</b> These are the wicked, who would cook it. And this is what is said: ״וימצאו אותו מקושש עצים״ — why did he need to gather wood? Rather, because he was wicked, he wished to cook the manna."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:23.073541920Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}